Use an explicit cluster administrator context to grant only GET on the exact Secret referenced by an approved Kubernetes source. Existing unrelated RBAC is never replaced. Revoke this grant before removing the source metadata.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime credential source authorize-kubernetes NAME [flags]

Flags:
      --context string      Explicit Kubernetes context
  -h, --help                help for authorize-kubernetes
      --kubeconfig string   Explicit kubeconfig path
      --namespace string    Approved source namespace (required)
      --revoke              Revoke this source's exact Secret read permission
      --yes                 Confirm the provider permission change

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
